{"id":"289eaf1d577b4823","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-locally-small.md","title":"df-locally-small","display":"df-locally-small","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-locally-small","aliases":["16-df-locally-small","Locally small fibration"],"display":"df-locally-small","depends_on":["[[16-df-cleavage]]","[[16-df-substitution-functor]]","[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"source":"Definition 9.5.1, pp. 559–560 (PDF 579–580)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-locally-small"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-locally-small</span><span>Locally small fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-locally-small"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f12a7a1ec4908770\" href=\"?note=f12a7a1ec4908770\" title=\"16-df-substitution-functor\">16-df-substitution-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"298460dd9013dccf\" href=\"?note=298460dd9013dccf\" title=\"16-thm-substitution-functoriality\">16-thm-substitution-functoriality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 9.5.1, pp. 559–560 (PDF 579–580)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\">\\(u^*\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f12a7a1ec4908770\" href=\"?note=f12a7a1ec4908770\" title=\"16-df-substitution-functor\">16-df-substitution-functor</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{a,b,X}:a^*b^*X\\to(ba)^*X\">\\(c_{a,b,X}:a^*b^*X\\to(ba)^*X\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"298460dd9013dccf\" href=\"?note=298460dd9013dccf\" title=\"16-thm-substitution-functoriality\">16-thm-substitution-functoriality</a> 的规范相干同构。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\">\\(X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:H\\to I\">\\(h:H\\to I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon:h^*X\\to h^*Y\">\\(\\epsilon:h^*X\\to h^*Y\\)</span> 为候选代表数据，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 垂直。所有对象、箭头及族按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a> 的足够大宇宙约定编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocSmall}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{LocSmall}(p)\\)</span> 在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的语境下定义；下式保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>，因此不要求分裂。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_J(A,B)\">\\(\\mathcal E_J(A,B)\\)</span> 表示纤维 Hom。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LocSmall}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\n(\\exists H\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists h:H\\to I)\n(\\exists\\epsilon\\in\\mathcal E_H(h^*X,h^*Y))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u:J\\to I)\n(\\forall f\\in\\mathcal E_J(u^*X,u^*Y))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\exists!v:J\\to H)\\bigl[\nhv=u\\land c_{v,h,Y}\\circ v^*\\epsilon\\circ c_{v,h,X}^{-1}=f\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LocSmall}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\n(\\exists H\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists h:H\\to I)\n(\\exists\\epsilon\\in\\mathcal E_H(h^*X,h^*Y))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u:J\\to I)\n(\\forall f\\in\\mathcal E_J(u^*X,u^*Y))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\exists!v:J\\to H)\\bigl[\nhv=u\\land c_{v,h,Y}\\circ v^*\\epsilon\\circ c_{v,h,X}^{-1}=f\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这给出代表箭头和泛垂直箭头的完整条件。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的对应箭头是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{v,h,Y}v^*\\epsilon c_{v,h,X}^{-1}\">\\(c_{v,h,Y}v^*\\epsilon c_{v,h,X}^{-1}\\)</span>；沿切片箭头再重索引时，相干结合律和唯一性保证自然性。因此自然性不再只靠本节补充到原先的逐对象双射中。</li>\n<li>定义不依赖 cleavage：两种选择的重索引之间有规范自然同构，用其共轭代表箭头即可双向转移泛性质。分裂时所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是恒等，得到 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2fec5704f304349d\" href=\"?note=2fec5704f304349d\" title=\"16-df-locally-small-fibration\">16-df-locally-small-fibration</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Definition 9.5.1, pp. 559–560（PDF 579–580）；本页展开非分裂情形中的虚线笛卡尔介体。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cleavage]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution-functor","status":"resolved","id":"f12a7a1ec4908770","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality","status":"resolved","id":"298460dd9013dccf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution-functor","status":"resolved","id":"f12a7a1ec4908770","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$；$u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution-functor]]。$c_{a,b,X}:a^*b^*X\\to(ba)^*X$ 采用 [[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]] 的规范相干同构。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality","status":"resolved","id":"298460dd9013dccf","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$；$u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution-functor]]。$c_{a,b,X}:a^*b^*X\\to(ba)^*X$ 采用 [[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]] 的规范相干同构。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$，$X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I$；$h:H\\to I$、$\\epsilon:h^*X\\to h^*Y$ 为候选代表数据，$\\epsilon$ 垂直。所有对象、箭头及族按 [[16-df-category]] 的足够大宇宙约定编码。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-locally-small-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"2fec5704f304349d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"定义不依赖 cleavage：两种选择的重索引之间有规范自然同构，用其共轭代表箭头即可双向转移泛性质。分裂时所有 $c$ 是恒等，得到 [[16-df-locally-small-fibration]] 的 $\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u^*","display":false},{"tex":"c_{a,b,X}:a^*b^*X\\to(ba)^*X","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"h:H\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon:h^*X\\to h^*Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocSmall}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_J(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LocSmall}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\n(\\exists H\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists h:H\\to I)\n(\\exists\\epsilon\\in\\mathcal E_H(h^*X,h^*Y))\\\\\n&\\quad(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u:J\\to I)\n(\\forall f\\in\\mathcal E_J(u^*X,u^*Y))\\\\\n&\\qquad(\\exists!v:J\\to H)\\bigl[\nhv=u\\land c_{v,h,Y}\\circ v^*\\epsilon\\circ c_{v,h,X}^{-1}=f\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"c_{v,h,Y}v^*\\epsilon c_{v,h,X}^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)","display":false}],"bytes":2248,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-279","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-locally-small|df-locally-small]]"}],"outgoing":["4ea27d39c2af987b","f12a7a1ec4908770","298460dd9013dccf","25a281534aa42440","2fec5704f304349d"]}